WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.251
This supplied fictional example uses the existing intake

00:00:03.274 --> 00:00:07.454
tabletop and retained files. The portfolio index identifies

00:00:07.512 --> 00:00:10.786
six journey results and the final artifact, tests,

00:00:11.041 --> 00:00:16.474
revision, demonstration, responsible statement, positioning set, and continuation

00:00:16.532 --> 00:00:19.679
plan. Each entry points to a meaningful version

00:00:19.772 --> 00:00:23.231
and evidence reference. The missing pilot permission stays

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:26.467
pending. The author does not create extra versions

00:00:26.502 --> 00:00:29.184
of completed assignments or describe fictional tests as

00:00:29.265 --> 00:00:32.110
live delivery. Your index must point to your

00:00:32.168 --> 00:00:35.001
actual retained work. A polished list does not

00:00:35.059 --> 00:00:36.301
replace missing evidence.
